(text "5 V input" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5313697d-a69a-5815-bda0-4e77c28abd83"))
(text "USB-C sink at 5 V only: 5.1k Rd on CC1/CC2, up to 3 A from a Type-C source, USBLC6 clamp on VBUS and CC, 3 A polyfuse. J1001 hands the fused VBUS to the SW6106 charger/boost module (the battery charges from the carrier USB-C) and takes the 5 V rail back from it. JP1001 (closed) feeds the rail from USB directly for a bench without the module: open it when the SW6106 is in the loop. U1001 (ideal diode) feeds the rail to the P4 5 V pins and blocks the P4 USB from the rail." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ade75779-ca5f-5270-96fd-1f55d668c3b8"))
